1. PURPOSE

Cuentiva is a production application and a public reference implementation intended to demonstrate software architecture, Swift, SwiftUI, Swift Concurrency, StoreKit, and related development techniques.

The source code is made publicly available so developers may read, study, evaluate, and learn from the implementation. Public availability does not place the software in the public domain and does not grant unrestricted rights to copy, redistribute, publish, sublicense, or sell it.

